NOTE ON THE JOB DATA

This MIT license covers the example code, OpenAPI specification, and
documentation in this repository.

It does not cover the remote job listing data served by the Himalayas Remote
Jobs API. That data is free to use, including commercially, subject to these
terms:

  * Link back to the job's URL on himalayas.app (the `applicationLink` or
    `guid` field) wherever you display a listing.
  * Credit Himalayas as the source of the data.
  * Do not resubmit Himalayas listings to third-party job aggregators,
    including but not limited to Jooble, Neuvoo, Google Jobs, and
    LinkedIn Jobs.

Questions about usage: hi@himalayas.app
